    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Emperor’s Chosen",
    "summary": "Each time you select an **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit of yours to attack, its attacks may re-roll a single **[Hit roll](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)** and a single **[Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)**.\n\n**Favoured Ka’tah: Rendax**: a unit using Rendax may also pick an enemy **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit **engaged** with it and roll a D6:\n\n- On a roll of 1-2, it takes 1 **mortal wound**.\n- On a roll of 3-5, it takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds).\n- On a roll of 6, it takes 3 mortal wounds.",
